\
====================================================\
1. PURPOSE\
====================================================\
ByajLite helps small lenders and shopkeepers maintain a simple digital ledger\
for money lent (credit) and collected (debit). It replaces paper udhar books \
with a fast, offline-first, reliable mobile app.\
\
The MVP focuses on:\
- Simple ledger entries\
- Optional interest per credit entry\
- Accurate outstanding balances\
- Automatic interest accrual\
- Data backup & sync\
- Zero learning curve\
\
\
====================================================\
2. TARGET USERS\
====================================================\
- Small shopkeepers\
- Micro-lenders\
- Local service providers\
- Rural and semi-urban lenders\
- Users switching from paper udhar books\
\
Characteristics:\
- Low digital familiarity\
- Use low-end Android devices\
- Frequently offline\
- Need extremely simple workflows\
\
\
====================================================\
3. USER PROBLEMS\
====================================================\
1. Paper registers are error-prone.\
2. Manual calculations cause disputes.\
3. Hard to track outstanding balances.\
4. No backup \uc0\u8594  fear of losing data.\
5. Interest calculation is time-consuming.\
\
\
====================================================\
4. MVP GOALS\
====================================================\
- Replace paper udhar registers.\
- Allow easy credit/debit entries.\
- Auto-calculate interest periodically.\
- Display accurate outstanding amounts.\
- Provide safe cloud backup.\
- Ensure offline-first usability.\
\
\
====================================================\
5. OUT OF SCOPE (FOR MVP)\
====================================================\
- EMI schedules\
- Automated WhatsApp/SMS reminders\
- Payment gateway\
- Field agent / staff workflows\
- Multi-user / roles\
- PDF receipts or exports\
- Complex analytics\
- KYC or onboarding flows\
- Compounding interest\
- EMI or amortization tables\
\
\
====================================================\
6. CORE MVP FEATURES\
====================================================\
\
----------------------------------------------------\
6.1 LOGIN / SIGNUP (OTP)\
----------------------------------------------------\
GOAL: Simple onboarding using phone number only.\
\
Requirements:\
- User enters phone number.\
- OTP sent via SMS.\
- Auto-read OTP (Android) if permission granted.\
- After success \uc0\u8594  go to Home Dashboard.\
- Store user name + business name (optional).\
\
Success Criteria:\
- OTP verification median < 10 seconds.\
- 85%+ login completion.\
\
\
----------------------------------------------------\
6.2 HOME DASHBOARD\
----------------------------------------------------\
Components:\
- Total Outstanding (sum of all customer balances).\
- Quick Actions:\
  - Add Customer\
  - Add Entry (Add Transaction)\
- Optional: last 3 recent transactions.\
\
Requirements:\
- Show outstanding from local DB.\
- Update instantly on any transaction.\
\
\
----------------------------------------------------\
6.3 CUSTOMER LIST\
----------------------------------------------------\
Components:\
- Customer name\
- Phone (optional)\
- Outstanding balance\
- Tap \uc0\u8594  Customer Detail / Ledger\
\
Requirements:\
- Search by name/phone\
- Sort by: most recently updated (default)\
- No filters in MVP\
\
\
----------------------------------------------------\
6.4 ADD CUSTOMER\
----------------------------------------------------\
Fields:\
- Name (required)\
- Phone (optional)\
- Notes (optional)\
\
Requirements:\
- Basic validation\
- Store locally & sync when online\
\
\
----------------------------------------------------\
6.5 CUSTOMER DETAIL / LEDGER VIEW\
----------------------------------------------------\
GOAL: Show all transactions for the customer.\
\
Components:\
- Customer name + phone\
- Outstanding balance\
- Ledger entries (latest first)\
\
Entry types:\
- Credit (money given)\
- Debit (money received)\
- System-generated Interest entry\
\
User Actions:\
- Add Transaction\
- Edit entry (within 24 hours)\
- Delete entry\
\
\
----------------------------------------------------\
6.6 ADD TRANSACTION (CREDIT / DEBIT)\
----------------------------------------------------\
Fields:\
- Amount (required)\
- Type: Credit / Debit\
- Date (default: today)\
- Notes (optional)\
\
Business Logic:\
- Credit = increases outstanding\
- Debit = reduces outstanding\
- New balance = previous \'b1 amount\
\
UX:\
- Fast 1\'962 tap flow\
- Confirmation toast after entry\
\
\
----------------------------------------------------\
6.7 INTEREST LOGIC (INTEGRATED INTO LEDGER)\
----------------------------------------------------\
GOAL:\
Allow user to add simple interest to a credit entry.\
Interest should auto-accrue based on cycle (daily/weekly/monthly/yearly).\
\
Trigger:\
Interest options appear ONLY if entry type = Credit.\
\
Fields:\
[ ] Charge Interest\
    Interest Rate (%)   [e.g., 5]\
    Interest Cycle      (Daily / Weekly / Monthly / Yearly)\
    Start Date          (default today)\
\
Calculation:\
Simple Interest Only:\
Interest = Principal \'d7 Rate \'d7 Time\
\
Where Time depends on cycle:\
- Daily   \uc0\u8594  number of days\
- Weekly  \uc0\u8594  number of weeks\
- Monthly \uc0\u8594  number of months\
- Yearly  \uc0\u8594  number of years\
\
Accrual Rules:\
- Interest is added once per cycle.\
- System auto-generates ledger entries:\
  Type: \'93Interest Added\'94\
  Amount: \uc0\u8377 X\
  Timestamp: auto-generated\
\
These entries update outstanding balance.\
\
Display:\
- In confirmation: interest amount + next interest date\
- In ledger: interest entries shown with timestamps\
\
Constraints:\
- No compound interest\
- No EMI schedule\
- Interest cannot be edited later (but entry can be deleted)\
- Works offline; interest added when app opens if cycles elapsed\
\
\
----------------------------------------------------\
6.8 PROFILE & SETTINGS\
----------------------------------------------------\
Fields:\
- User name\
- Business name\
- Logout\
\
Future (not MVP):\
- Language selection\
- Theme options\
\
\
----------------------------------------------------\
6.9 DATA BACKUP / SYNC SETTINGS\
----------------------------------------------------\
GOAL:\
Ensure data safety and continuity across phones.\
\
Requirements:\
- Auto-sync ledger + customers when online\
- Manual "Sync Now" button\
- Show:\
  \'93Last synced at <timestamp>\'94\
\
Sync Logic:\
- Timestamp-based conflict resolution (latest wins)\
- Batches of customers + ledger entries\
\
Data Stored on Cloud:\
- Users\
- Customers\
- Transactions\
- Interest rules\
- Settings\
\
\
====================================================\
7. NON-FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS\
====================================================\
\
Performance:\
- Add transaction < 1 sec\
- Ledger load < 1 sec\
\
Offline-First:\
- All features work offline\
- Sync queued for later\
\
Error Handling:\
- OTP retry if failed\
- Sync retry on failure with exponential backoff\
\
Security:\
- Local DB encryption (SQLCipher)\
- HTTPS for all API calls\
- Token-based auth\
\
App Size:\
- Target < 25 MB APK\
\
\
====================================================\
8. TECH ARCHITECTURE OVERVIEW\
====================================================\
\
Mobile App:\
- React Native or Flutter\
- Local DB: SQLite\
\
Backend Services:\
1. Auth (OTP)\
2. User + Customer + Ledger CRUD\
3. Sync Service (offline reconciliation)\
\
Database:\
- Firestore OR Postgres + Node backend\
\
Cloud Storage:\
- Customer/ledger snapshots\
\
\
====================================================\
9. SUCCESS METRICS (MVP)\
====================================================\
- Daily Transactions per User\
- % of users with >5 customers added\
- Sync success rate > 95%\
- Crash-free rate > 99%\
- 30-day retention > 30%\
- Zero data-loss complaints\
\
